[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "時は少し遡る――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Time rewinds a little—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "（システム）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(System)"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これで……うん！\u3000いい感じ！\n最後はよーくかき混ぜて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There we go... Perfect! Now to stir it thoroughly..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "できた！\u3000クラフト！\nミミちゃん、先輩方、見てくださ――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Done! Craft! Mimi, everyone, take a look—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "って、いないんだった。\nついいつもの癖で……えへへ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, right. No one's here. Force of habit... Ehehe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（年末年始が近づくこの頃。\n\u3000私の通うランターナ学園は冬休みに入りました）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(As the year draws to a close, Lantarna Academy is on winter break.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ミミちゃんや先輩方を含め、ほとんどの生徒が\n\u3000この長いお休みを利用して帰省しているみたいです）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Most of the students, including Mimi and the others, have taken advantage of this long holiday to return home.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（補講もないし、私も帰省して故郷の家族や親友に\n\u3000会いに行こうかなと思ったけれど……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(There aren't any makeup classes either, so I thought about going home to visit my family and friends, but...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし、同じ手順でもう１回！\n次はもっと丁寧に、ゆっくり釜をかき混ぜてみよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right, one more time following the same steps! This time I'll stir the cauldron more carefully and slowly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（今はそれ以上に、錬金術の腕を磨きたい！\n\u3000ということで、一人学園に残っているのでした）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Right now, I want to hone my alchemy skills even more! That's why I stayed behind at the academy by myself.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにしても……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even so..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "冬休みの間、部室を使って自由に調合していいなんて！\n欣喜雀躍！\u3000この機を逃す手はありません！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being able to use the clubroom for synthesis whenever I want during winter break! I'm over the moon! There's no way I'd pass up this opportunity!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不肖レスナ、皆さんが戻って来るまで\nこの大切な部室を誠心誠意守ってみせます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I, Resna, shall guard this precious clubroom with all my heart until everyone returns!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きゃあ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はは、はい！\u3000どちら様でしょうか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes! Who's there?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ！\u3000見つけた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah! Found you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃーん！\u3000遊びに来たよー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resnaaaa! I came to visit!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、その声は――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That voice—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "会いたかったよ、レスナちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I missed you, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナ学園、錬金術科の１年生。\n錬金術を愛しており、日々研鑽に励んでいる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A first-year student in Lantarna Academy's alchemy program. She loves alchemy and devotes herself to daily training."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ・シュテルネンリヒト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna Sternenlicht"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]